su name katago mind runner ob text payload be ceremony def
  exists su name cmd ob text "PYA_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_MS=900000 node command/katago_runner.mjs" be text ya
  ob text of ob of this to name text payload text local be text do
  ob text of cmd fromtext name payload text local be command do
prah

su name katago command mind ob text payload be ceremony def
  su name run ob text of ob of this be katago mind runner do
  su name run ret
prah

su name katago analyze ob text sgf be ceremony def
  exists su name cmd ob text "PYA_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_MS=900000 node command/katago_runner.mjs" be text ya
  ob text of ob of this to name text sgf text local be text do
  ob text of cmd fromtext name sgf text local be command do
prah

exists su name katago command mind be export ya
exists su name katago analyze be export ya
